('d6e9b748-9187-4f93-a5df-b802c567f60c', 'Realist Maou ni Yoru Seiiki Naki Isekai Kaikaku', 'Hata Ryousuke', 'Suzuki Manatsu', 'In a dilapidated castle, Astaroth awoke as a Demon King. With his ''wisdom from his past life,'' he would rule over his lands as a thorough ''realist.''

